  "specific_visual_differences": {
    "logo": "Readable CASCADE, italic serif, note and flourish preserved. The redrawn C, glyph contours, tiny stars, gradient and broad glow differ; it is raster artwork rather than live editable text.",
    "pause": "Symbol and plum rounded button preserved. Redrawn body is about 8% wider than tall; uniform fit to 61px width produces roughly 56.5px height, so center it vertically. Its neon glow and rim are stronger than the source.",
    "sphere1": "Correct cyan glass and single note. Highlight/edge facets and note contour differ; outer cyan halo is broader.",
    "sphere2": "Correct green glass and single note. More conspicuous facet pattern and broad lime halo; its raw PNG body is larger than cyan, so use per-asset scaling.",
    "sphere3": "Correct amber glass and paired note. Facet reflections and note weight differ. Raw body is smaller than green in the same-size PNG, so equal image widths would create inconsistent sphere sizes.",
    "sphere4": "Correct violet crystal crown and gold treble clef. Crown has more pronounced long top/bottom points and a larger central clef; preserve its own proportions. At a 114px bounding height it is about 110.4px wide.",
